# 基本図形編集のプロセスの文字枠から、選んだ文字をウインドウの外へ運び出す (design 11.3), for
# tools/ui_run.py. A figure of 30 small rectangles, two zigzag lines and one piece of text "ABC"
# (mkbig fig 30 4 1; its box from 210,247 to 330,287 on the screen) is opened with the process
# (its window 100,100 800x600), the text pressed twice to edit it and its letters picked. Then,
# each from a figure as it was read:
#   1. 速いドラッグ: pressed on the letters picked, the hand straight out of the window in one
#      move to 1000,500, onto the document TADjsについて that the desktop opened at the start,
#      the button let go at once. No move in the window is heard before the hand goes out
#      (OB_E_LEAVE): the process follows the move out first, so it is a carry and not a click.
#      The letters go to the document as one line (document: letters dropped) and leave the text.
#   2. ゆっくりのドラッグ: the same, the hand moved out in steps: the same comes of it.
#   3. クリック: pressed on the letters picked and let go where it was: the caret goes there,
#      nothing is carried.
# The keys go to the window let go on: the figure's name band is pressed to give them back
# to it, which ends the editing of the text. Record 0 saved after 1 and after 2 is the same,
# the text without its letters (sum 4412 a0d26d9531bddb65 where the figure read is 4415
# b767ea9c87188e0f); after 3 it is the figure as it was read.
# Keys: Escape 29; with Ctrl (01) S 16, E 08.
mkbig fig 30 4 1; its box from 210,247 to 330,287 on the screen) is opened with the process,
# the text pressed twice to edit it and "AB" picked. Then, each from a figure as it was read:
#   1. 速いドラッグ: pressed on the letters picked, the hand straight out of the window in one
#      move onto the document TADjsについて that the desktop opened at the start, the button let
#      go at once. No move in the window is heard before the hand goes out (OB_E_LEAVE): the
#      process follows the move out first, so it is a carry and not a click. The letters go
#      to the document as one line (document: letters dropped) and leave the text.
#   2. ゆっくりのドラッグ: the same, the hand moved out in steps: the same comes of it.
#   3. クリック: pressed on the letters picked and let go where it was: the caret goes there,
#      nothing is carried.
# The keys go to the window let go on: the figure's name band is pressed to give them back
# to it. Record 0 saved after 1 and after 2 is the same, and not the figure as it was read;
# after 3 it is the figure as it was read.
# Keys: Escape 29; with Ctrl (01) S 16, E 08.
mkbig fig 30 4 1
sum
keep read
logmark
pfig big
expectsincein 60 figure: opened 画用紙 shapes 33
wait 500
logmark
dclick 215 255
expectsince figure: text editing begun
drag 213 258 236 258
wait 300
logmark
hold 218 258
move 1000 500
up
expectsincein 10 figure: left the window carrying letters
expectsincein 10 figure: letters carried out (0)
expectsincein 10 document: letters dropped
wait 500
logmark
click 500 112
expectsince figure: text editing ended
wait 300
logmark
key 16 01
expectsince figure: saved (0)
sum show
want ok 4412 a0d26d9531bddb65
keep carried
logmark
key 08 01
expectsince figure: closed
wait 500
# 2. the same, slowly
mkbig fig 30 4 1
logmark
pfig big
expectsincein 60 figure: opened 画用紙 shapes 33
wait 500
logmark
dclick 215 255
expectsince figure: text editing begun
drag 213 258 236 258
wait 300
logmark
hold 218 258
move 260 270
wait 200
move 400 330
wait 200
move 800 420
wait 200
move 1000 500
wait 300
up
expectsincein 10 figure: letters carried out (0)
expectsincein 10 document: letters dropped
wait 500
logmark
click 500 112
expectsince figure: text editing ended
wait 300
logmark
key 16 01
expectsince figure: saved (0)
sum show
same carried
logmark
key 08 01
expectsince figure: closed
wait 500
# 3. a click on the letters picked
mkbig fig 30 4 1
logmark
pfig big
expectsincein 60 figure: opened 画用紙 shapes 33
wait 500
logmark
dclick 215 255
expectsince figure: text editing begun
drag 213 258 236 258
wait 300
logmark
click 218 258
wait 300
key 29
expectsince figure: text editing ended
logmark
key 16 01
expectsince figure: saved (0)
sum show
same read
logmark
key 08 01
expectsince figure: closed
wait 500
absent !OACV!
